{"status":"completed","summary":"Built and verified CORP.EXAMPLE with two replicated controllers, a domain-member engineering file server, and a joined client. DNS, Kerberos, authentication, and writable SMB access remained available during separate DC1 and DC2 outages; both controllers are restored and healthy.","actions_performed":["Provisioned DC1 on node1 and joined DC2 on node2.","Bound AD, DNS, Kerberos, and SMB services to the dedicated 10.100.241.0/24 identity network.","Created infrasetuser and the engineering group with replicated membership.","Joined node3 and published /srv/corp/engineering with group write access and the requested welcome.txt.","Joined node4 and created /root/corp-user.env with a managed-node-generated password and mode 0600.","Tested each controller outage independently, restored each service, synchronized all naming contexts, and confirmed zero database errors."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Replicated CORP.EXAMPLE controllers on node1 and node2","command_ids":["cmd-3518c6f2e8ac4c1a","cmd-d253723701324711","cmd-2aa4ac9e2bec46ce","cmd-569164f49d4e4a81"],"summary":"Both enabled controllers report the CORP.EXAMPLE AD role; all naming contexts replicate successfully with zero consecutive failures, and both databases pass checks with 0 errors."},{"requirement":"Dedicated identity network for directory, DNS, Kerberos, and SMB","command_ids":["cmd-587330c516ae43d2","cmd-c6fcfba0e5784b39","cmd-fb7ec942988e4ecb","cmd-16a6c76cc9824c58","cmd-e148e4b6800a43f0"],"summary":"Controllers listen on 10.100.241.10/.11 for DNS, Kerberos, LDAP, and SMB; FS1 listens on 10.100.241.12; member/client routes select enp8s0 with 10.100.241.x source addresses."},{"requirement":"engineering group and infrasetuser membership","command_ids":["cmd-0a161e31f7c449f7","cmd-44d49b6e64bf472c","cmd-d8135e0c75d14fa2","cmd-3518c6f2e8ac4c1a","cmd-d253723701324711"],"summary":"The enabled user was created, added to engineering on DC2, replicated to DC1, and is present with the 